aviour started to change dramatically.</summary></entry><entry><title>Northern Lights dazzle skies across the UK</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9rkyey458xdo#3</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T09:18:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9rkyey458xdo--4008a27dc746.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9rkyey458xdo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The natural phenomenon, known as the Aurora Borealis, is the result of increased solar activity.</summary></entry><entry><title>Ukraine strikes Yandex data centre in third attack on Russian tech giant</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw0k0g57mk3zo#3</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:38:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw0k0g57mk3zo--9c456bbec7c9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw0k0g57mk3zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">It is the third time this week that Ukraine has targeted Russian tech giant Yandex, forcing the company to suspend its operations.</summary></entry><entry><title>Children among 109 dead after boat capsizes off Djibouti, UN says</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwy7lxx60dg5o#3</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T12:08:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwy7lxx60dg5o--247efd53ed44.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwy7lxx60dg5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The boat was travelling from Djibouti to Yemen with 350 people on board, when it capsized near the port town of Obock on Thursday night.</summary></entry><entry><title>Why are so many four-year-olds not potty-trained before school?</title><id>https: